An app to help me learn German. The app should:

Support accounts that can seamlessly switch between web and app (Android and iphone). Users should be able to do a lesson on the app one day and on a browser the next day and the system should remember what they did. The look and feel should also be similar between the two
Be easy to develop with minimal technical expertise. This will be a solo project for me, and I am moderately technically proficient, but cannot code.
The key feature will be a chat feature.
Users should be able to
  Select and tune the "personality" of the app
  select one of several dynamic topical topics
  define their own topic
  Input their answers as either text or speech (in German)
The system should
  Converse back in the user's selected personality (in German)
  Allow users to easily translate any German text they don't understand - e.g. by tapping or hovering over it.
  Offer feedback on any errors the user makes, including explaining the grammatical rules that they have broken, why their answer was incorrect, and how to correct it.
